<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a machine model to the family consisting of the languages recognized by machines of that model. Each machine recognizes an individual language. The assertion has no symmetry or transitive closure."@en <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
