<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a method to an input condition assumed in the stated standard application or guarantee. A violation removes that guarantee and need not make every run fail."@en <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
