<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
